{"at":"2026-02-26T21:48:10.975Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":1511,"status":"published","language":"en","path":"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/core-workflow/import-properties/","title":"Import Properties","description":null,"body":"<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 12px 0px 8px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 28px; font-family: inherit !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\"></span></p><span style=\"font-size:1rem\"><h1 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 12px 0px 8px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 28px; font-family: inherit !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\">Import Properties</span></h1><h1 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 12px 0px 8px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 28px; font-family: inherit !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important;\"></span></h1><h2><div class=\"shortcode_title\"></div><div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\"><div class=\"doc-content-wrap\"><div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"10426\" class=\"elementor elementor-10426\"><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dcf617d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"dcf617d\" data-element_type=\"container\"><div class=\"e-con-inner\"><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ed1dce9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ed1dce9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><h2 style=\"color: rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.78); line-height: 1.65;\"><strong></strong></h2><span style=\"font-size:0.875rem\"><h2 style=\"color: rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.78); line-height: 1.65;\"><strong>Import Your Listings:</strong></h2><ol><li><p style=\"color: rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.78); line-height: 1.65;\">During sign-up make sure to have your import URL from your current property listing company. The URL should point to an XML feed containing only your&nbsp;<strong>own property data. “own properties”</strong></p></li><li><p style=\"color: rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.78); line-height: 1.65;\">Paste the import URL to start the import process. Our software handles all major formats seamlessly. (For any issues, please contact support)</p></li><li><p style=\"color: rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.78); line-height: 1.65;\">Done. Your listing will be approved, usually within a few business hours.</p></li></ol><div><span style=\"color:rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.78)\"><br></span></div><p style=\"color: rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.78); line-height: 1.65;\"><strong>Please note:&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;Imports are accepted during sign-up to quickly upload all your properties. After that, you need to update properties within the PropertyList platform and add new properties manually.</p><p style=\"color: rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.78); line-height: 1.65;\">If you did not upload at sign-in and need to add your xml link please&nbsp;<a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/additional-resources/mls-support/\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\">contact support</a>.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"color: rgba(11, 18, 32, 0.78); line-height: 1.65;\">&nbsp;</p><div><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-listings/export-listings-xml/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\">To learn how to Export Properties click here</a></div></span><div><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-listings/export-listings-xml/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\"></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></h2></span><h2><div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\"><div class=\"doc-content-wrap\"><div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"10426\" class=\"elementor elementor-10426\"><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dcf617d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"dcf617d\" data-element_type=\"container\"><div class=\"e-con-inner\"><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ed1dce9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ed1dce9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><div><a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-listings/export-listings-xml/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 154);\"></a></div><div><br style=\"font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></h2>","seo_title":"Import Properties • PropertyList Info Hub","seo_description":null}}